#: ../../source/datasets/catalog/xes3g5m.md:1 832e3066ff3d420ba529b160e223cb57
msgid "XES3G5M"
msgstr "XES3G5M"

#: ../../source/datasets/catalog/xes3g5m.md:3 26137577612c4a5f936d514d2161e6d6
msgid "XES3G5M 是采集自好未来学而思三年级数学课程的知识追踪基准数据集，提供题目与知识概念两级序列以及题目文本、解析和图片等辅助信息。"
msgstr ""
"XES3G5M is a knowledge tracing benchmark dataset collected from TAL "
"Education Xueersi 3rd-grade mathematics courses, providing question- and "
"knowledge-concept-level sequences alongside auxiliary question texts, "
"explanations, and images."

