#: ../../source/datasets/catalog/xes3g5m.md:22 dadb2dbda0e449cd930af4bf73adb6c6
msgid ""
"XES3G5M 源自 AAAI 2023 全球知识追踪挑战赛，官方发布包专为序列化建模设计，已预先按最大长度 200 进行窗口切分。UniKT "
"默认基于题目级序列 `question_level` 进行加载与评估。"
msgstr ""
"XES3G5M originates from the AAAI 2023 Global Knowledge Tracing Challenge;"
" the official release is tailored for sequential modeling, pre-split into"
" windows with maximum length 200. UniKT loads and evaluates on question-"
"level sequences `question_level` by default."

